WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.688
In the last years of Eastern Han, the land was in chaos and the people's lives were very hard.

00:00:06.038 --> 00:00:12.254
One day, Liu Bei, Guan Yu and Zhang Fei met in the peach garden, and the three felt like old friends at once.

00:00:12.604 --> 00:00:19.564
They knelt down together and swore to heaven: from now on they were sworn brothers, together in life and death.

00:00:19.914 --> 00:00:25.434
In the peach garden the blossoms were in full bloom, petals drifting gently down on the wind.

00:00:25.784 --> 00:00:31.040
That evening, the three brothers drank and celebrated in the peach garden, very happily.

00:00:31.390 --> 00:00:36.550
They raised their cups and promised to share good fortune together and face hardship together.

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:43.692
From then on, the three brothers set out together, resolved to win the land for the people's sake.

00:00:44.042 --> 00:00:48.338
Along the way, they looked after one another, and their bond grew deeper and deeper.

00:00:48.688 --> 00:00:55.000
The Oath of the Peach Garden became the most famous brotherhood in Chinese history.

00:00:55.350 --> 00:01:00.606
This story tells us that true friendship can stand the test of hardship.

